      "extract": "arXiv:math/0405126v1 [math.GT] 7 May 2004 ASYMPTOTIC BEHAVIORS OF THE COLORED JONES POLYNOMIALS OF A TORUS KNOT HITOSHI MURAKAMI Abstract. We study the asymptotic behaviors of the colored Jones polyno- mials of torus knots. Contrary to the works by R. Kashaev, O. Tirkkonen, Y. Yokota, and the author, they do not seem to give the volumes or the Chern–Simons invariants of the three-manifolds obtained by Dehn",
